IF PUMP G71F68Yp1 TIMEOPEN > 00:01
AND NODE G71F06R DEPTH > 0.36
OR NODE G72K020 DEPTH > 0.40
OR NODE G71F090 DEPTH > 0.791
OR NODE G71F68Y DEPTH < 0.43
THEN PUMP G71F68Yp1 STATUS = OFF
RULE CLOSE_05GATE_RAIN_CONDITION
